[{"answer":"I live in a house that has a small yard around it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/1.mp3"},{"answer":"In my yard there is a lawn and a garden.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/2.mp3"},{"answer":"There is also a sidewalk that leads to my front door,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and a driveway that leads to my garage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Throughout the year I work to maintain my yard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/5.mp3"},{"answer":"During the summer, I cut the grass","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/6.mp3"},{"answer":"that grows in my yard, using a lawn-mower.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I like the smell of the grass when it has just been cut.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/8.mp3"},{"answer":"But it's better not to cut the grass too short.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/9.mp3"},{"answer":"When the weather is dry,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I also put water on the lawn and garden,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/11.mp3"},{"answer":"so that the grass and flowers can grow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/12.mp3"},{"answer":"During the autumn,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/13.mp3"},{"answer":"many leaves fall from the trees in my yard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I use a rake to collect the leaves from the lawn.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Then I can put the leaves into bags.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I can use the leaves to make fertilizer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/17.mp3"},{"answer":"When I was a kid, I didn't like the job of raking leaves,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/18.mp3"},{"answer":"but now I don't mind it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Another job during the autumn is to remove flowers","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/20.mp3"},{"answer":"from the garden before cold weather arrives.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/21.mp3"},{"answer":"During the winter, there is no work to do in the lawn","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/22.mp3"},{"answer":"or garden, because they are covered in snow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/23.mp3"},{"answer":"But I need to keep the snow off my sidewalk and driveway.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Whenever it snows, I use a shovel to clear the snow from the sidewalk and the driveway.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes it snows a lot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/26.mp3"},{"answer":"If I didn't shovel the snow,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/27.mp3"},{"answer":"it would soon be impossible to get into my house!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/28.mp3"},{"answer":"During the spring, the snow melts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I clean up my yard by sweeping away the dirt","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/30.mp3"},{"answer":"and by removing weeds from the lawn and garden.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I also put flowers back into the garden.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/32.mp3"},{"answer":"It's nice to see them again after the long, cold winter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/33.mp3"},{"answer":"When spring comes, the grass grows very quickly,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/34.mp3"},{"answer":"so I need to cut the grass quite often.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Working in the yard can be very satisfying work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/36.mp3"},{"answer":"It's so nice when the lawn and garden are looking green and healthy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/129-working-in-my-yard-2019-04-07-04-22-19/37.mp3"}]
